---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact | IELTS Corner"
  description="Contact IELTS Corner for tutoring, writing feedback, study-plan help, or general IELTS and CELPIP questions."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/contact.webp');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 class="ic-display">Tell us what you need help with.</h1>
        <p>
          The clearer your message is, the more useful the reply can be. One short message
          with your exam, your current level, and your target is enough.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-7);"></div>

    <div class="surface contact-tip">
      <h2 class="ic-display" style="margin-top: 0;">Fastest way to get a useful reply</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">Include these three details in your first message:</p>
      <ol style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s-4);">
        <li>Your exam: IELTS, CELPIP, or general English</li>
        <li>Your current score or level, if you know it</li>
        <li>Your target score and deadline</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-2 contact-layout">
      <div>
        <h2 class="ic-display">Send a message</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 0;">
          Short and clear is fine. You do not need to write a long introduction.
        </p>

        {/* @ts-ignore */}
        <form
          name="contact"
          method="POST"
          netlify
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          class="stack contact-form"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />

          <p style="display: none;">
            <label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
          </p>

          <div>
            <label for="name" class="contact-label">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="contact-input" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="email" class="contact-label">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="contact-input" />
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="subject" class="contact-label">What do you need help with?</label>
            <select id="subject" name="subject" required class="contact-input">
              <option value="">Choose one</option>
              <option value="tutoring">Tutoring</option>
              <option value="writing-lab">AI Writing Lab</option>
              <option value="study-plan">Study plan question</option>
              <option value="lessons">Lesson question</option>
              <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label for="message" class="contact-label">Message</label>
            <textarea
              id="message"
              name="message"
              rows="7"
              required
              class="contact-input contact-textarea"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send message</button>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>Other ways to reach us</h2>

        <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
          <div class="surface contact-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">WhatsApp</h3>
            <p>Best for quick questions about timing, availability, or which service fits your situation.</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/16479317537" class="btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Open WhatsApp
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="surface contact-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Email</h3>
            <p>Best for detailed questions, writing samples, or anything you want to explain carefully.</p>
            <a href="mailto:kara.abdolmaleki@gmail.com" class="btn">
              kara.abdolmaleki@gmail.com
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="surface contact-box">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Services people ask about most</h3>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s-3);">
              <li><strong>Tutoring:</strong> CA$55 for a 60-minute live lesson</li>
              <li><strong>AI Writing Lab:</strong> CA$5/month for unlimited CELPIP writing evaluations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="surface contact-box contact-box--accent">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Response time</h3>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              We usually reply within 24 hours on business days. If your test date is close,
              say that in the first line so we can read your message in the right context.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-7);"></div>

    <div>
      <h2>Common questions before people contact us</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-2 contact-layout">
        <div class="surface contact-box">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">How do I book tutoring?</h3>
          <p>
            Send a tutoring message with your exam, current level, and target score.
            We reply with suitable times and the next booking step.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="surface contact-box">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">How do payments work?</h3>
          <p>
            Payment details are shared after the service is confirmed. Current options include
            Stripe, PayPal, and e-transfer when appropriate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="surface contact-box">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">What if I am not sure which service I need?</h3>
          <p>
            Tell us what exam task is hurting your score most. We can usually tell you whether
            free lessons, writing feedback, or tutoring is the better next step.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="surface contact-box">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">What if something is not the right fit?</h3>
          <p>
            Tell us quickly. The goal is to solve the problem directly, not make you chase support.
            Full details are also available on the <a href="/faq">FAQ page</a> and in the <a href="/terms">terms</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-7);"></div>

    <div class="surface" style="padding: var(--s-4);">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Explore other parts of the site</h2>
      <div class="cluster" style="margin-top: var(--s-3);">
        <a class="btn" href="/lessons">Free lessons</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/about">About the teacher</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/celpip">CELPIP Hub</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/ielts">IELTS Hub</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/ai-feedback">AI Writing Feedback</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">Book tutoring</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .contact-layout {
    gap: var(--s-5);
  }

  .contact-tip {
    padding: var(--s-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--s-2);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .contact-form {
    gap: var(--s-3);
  }

  .contact-label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-1);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .contact-input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .contact-textarea {
    min-height: 10rem;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .contact-box {
    padding: var(--s-3);
    border-radius: 14px;
  }

  .contact-box--accent {
    background: var(--accent-light);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
